        "ebe1dbeb-d8fc-4f0c-9d34-fc7892bde207": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "Main features",
            "collapse_content": "<p><strong>Designed for the bathroom mirror</strong></p><p>TapNest is the world’s first magnetic phone dock designed specifically for bathroom routines — keeping your phone elevated, visible, and hands-free exactly where you use it most.</p><p><strong>Magnetic snap-on experience</strong></p><p>Built for MagSafe-compatible iPhones and cases. Simply snap your phone into place for an effortless one-handed docking experience.</p><p><strong>Integrated NFC shortcuts</strong></p><p>Features 3 built-in NFC touch points that let you instantly launch playlists, podcasts, meditation, reminders, beauty tutorials, and more with a simple tap.</p><p><strong>Create your own rituals</strong></p><p>Customize your own NFC routines using Apple Shortcuts. From shower karaoke to morning affirmations, TapNest helps turn everyday habits into intentional moments.</p><p><strong>Soft-tech aesthetic</strong></p><p>Unlike traditional black, industrial-looking phone mounts, TapNest blends soft colors, rounded forms, and lifestyle-focused design into your space beautifully.</p><p><strong>Made for humid environments</strong></p><p>Designed for everyday bathroom conditions including humidity and light splashes. Best installed on mirrors, glass, tile, or other smooth surfaces.</p><p><strong>Compatibility</strong></p><ul><li>Compatible with MagSafe iPhones and MagSafe cases</li><li>NFC functionality depends on iPhone model and iOS settings</li><li>Not recommended for textured walls or painted drywall surfaces</li></ul><p><strong>What’s included</strong></p><ul><li>1 × OORA TapNest</li><li>Adhesive mounting system</li><li>NFC quick-start guide</li><li>OORA ritual setup inspiration card</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_Q7Fhxe": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "Shipping & returns",
            "collapse_content": "<p>Quick Dispatch: Orders shipped within 1-2 business days.<br/>Express Delivery: Available for an additional charge.<br/>14-Day Return Policy: Easy returns for a full refund or exchange.<br/>Return Shipping: Complimentary for defective or damaged items.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_cRztXf": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "Can my phone work?",
            "collapse_content": "<p>High-Grade Plastics: Durable and resistant to wear and tear in bathroom environment,<br/>Rubber: Ensures stability and friction for Phone docking.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_mdKxAA": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "Care guide",
            "collapse_content": "<p>Regular Dusting: Use a soft, dry cloth to wipe the surface and prevent dust accumulation.<br/>Avoid Moisture: Keep the speakers away from water and humidity to prevent damage.<br/>Proper Placement: Position the speakers on a stable surface to avoid falls and vibrations.<br/>Cable Management: Organize and secure cables to prevent tangling and wear.<br/>Firmware Updates: Check for and install any software updates to ensure the best performance.</p>"
          }
